{%- comment -%}
PFC Tasks: mirrors the "Tasks" band of the web home page (tasks_payload in
automations/scripts/trmnl_home.py). Today's picks (Pick 1, Pick 2, Bonus) with done
state as [x] / [ ] text, done of total, the no-picks note, and after about 6 PM the
tomorrow label and tomorrow's picks. Then "What needs you" (title + why) and
"Hand to an agent" (titles).

E-ink rules: no emoji, no inline styles, framework classes only.
{%- endcomment -%}
{% template pick_row %}
<div class="item">
  <div class="meta"></div>
  <div class="content">
    <span class="{{ text_class }}" data-clamp="{{ clamp }}">{% if pick.done %}[x]{% else %}[ ]{% endif %} {{ pick.kind }}: {{ pick.title }}</span>
  </div>
</div>
{% endtemplate %}
